    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57345" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κί̆θαρ-ις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιος</span>,
			ἡ, acc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίθαριν,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κιθάρα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> (who never uses the latter form), <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				1.153
			</span></i>, al., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Alc.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				5.65
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
				124
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>playing on the cithara</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἄν τοι χραισμῇ κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					3.54
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				8.248
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. καὶ ἀοιδή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					13.731
				</span></i>
			.</div>
